        "description": "Reimagine Collaboration. Redefine Engagement.\n\nMRx is the easy no-code solution for creating and deploying interactive and collaborative Mixed Reality  content.\n\nUse MRx to easily and quickly deploy Mixed Reality for learning and training, visualization, immersive presentations and engagements. \n\nGaze-and -drop assets, such as 3D objects, images and videos, directly into your space. Then apply interaction mechanics to create step-based interactive content.\n\nWhen ready, deploy your content automatically in collaborative session lobbies. You can facilitate multiple concurrent sessions off-device with the desktop session manager and access post-session reports to gain user interaction insights. \n\nThe companion Windows 11 desktop MRx Console app is required to run MRx.",
